<title>ITALY: Verona air cargo traffic up 0.6 pct in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>Verona air cargo traffic up 0.6 pct in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Verona airport carried 450 tonnes of air cargo traffic in February 1997, up 0.6 percent on the same period 1996,the airport authority said.</p>
<p>		   Feb 97     Pct change    Jan-Feb 97    Pct change</p>
<p> Total cargo   450	   up 0.6	  855	    up 2.0</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
